# Plan (opus, strong)

<!-- bot: {"difficulty": "medium", "why": "line 3 fails: the change adds ruling R1484000 and edits spec §12.11, 11-rulings.md and INDEX.md, beside a web-only code change" -->

## Goal

On `/creator`, a card with changes not yet saved is no longer dropped without a word:
- **Back** shows the existing unsaved-changes note ("This card has changes you haven't saved.", **Discard them** / **Keep editing**). Discard them goes to the landing page. Keep editing keeps the draft.
- **Reload or closed tab:** while unsaved work is held, a cancelable `beforeunload` is default-prevented, so the browser asks first.
- **Nothing to lose:** a saved card, or a new card nobody has touched, leaves at once with no listener. The listener is removed after a save and on unmount.

The behaviour becomes a new ruling, R1484000, written into SPEC §12.11. The issue says §12.9, but the creator is §12.11; §12.9 is "Saved on the account".

## Files to touch

| Path | new/change | What |
|---|---|---|
| `apps/web/src/creator/Creator.tsx` | change | new exported `UnsavedNote` component; `CreatorProps.onUnsaved`; an `unsaved` value in `Creator`, which `open()` uses and an effect reports |
| `apps/web/src/routes/creator.tsx` | change | `unsaved`/`leaving` state, `BackLink onPress`, the route's `UnsavedNote`, the `beforeunload` effect; header comment |
| `apps/web/src/routes/creator.test.tsx` | new | five `R1484000` tests |
| `spec/rulings/R1484000.md` | new | the ruling note |
| `spec/12-custom-cards.md` | change | one sentence at the end of §12.11 linking [[R1484000]] |
| `spec/11-rulings.md` | change | one entry for R1484000 at the end of the file |
| `spec/INDEX.md` | change | regenerated by `cargo jackioh spec index`, never edited by hand |

Do not touch:
- `crates/`: no engine, cards, AI or server change.
- `apps/web/src/creator/Creator.test.tsx` and `apps/web/src/routes/nav.tsx`.
- `apps/web/src/i18n/zh-CN.json`: no new sentence, because the note's three strings already have entries.
- `e2e/`, `.github/`, `.harness/`, `.squishy/`, `bot/`.
- No new dependency.

Governing spec:
- §12.11 (the creator) and §12.9.
- R915010 (the creator).
- R668 (practice's `beforeunload` pattern).
- R256 (the deck builder's local copy, the alternative rejected).
- CLAUDE.md rules 3 and 7.

## Steps

1. **`apps/web/src/creator/Creator.tsx`, new `UnsavedNote`.** Directly above `export function Creator(`, add:

